<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>救生艇新闻：博客——保护人类</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/</link><description></description><lastBuildDate>Mon, 03 Aug 2026 14:11:38 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>无人机视频捕捉到座头鲸出生的罕见镜头：“一个非凡的时刻”</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/rare-footage-of-humpback-whale-birth-captured-on-drone-video-a-remarkable-moment</link><description>该组织在社交媒体上表示，ORRCA 团队的成员也加入了福雷斯特的行列，持续监测母牛和小牛几个小时的情况，“收集小牛生命中关键的最初几个小时的观察结果”。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/rare-footage-of-humpback-whale-birth-captured-on-drone-video-a-remarkable-moment.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 03 Aug 2026 14:11:34 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/rare-footage-of-humpback-whale-birth-captured-on-drone-video-a-remarkable-moment</guid></item><item><title>我们能战胜人类衰老吗？</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/can-we-defeat-human-aging</link><description>&lt;img src="https://politepaul.com/fd/dtDF30237DhP.xml" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 03 Aug 2026 13:56:34 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/can-we-defeat-human-aging</guid></item><item><title>将每辆车、工厂和建筑变成电源</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/turning-every-vehicle-factory-and-building-into-a-power-source</link><description>创新者介绍了数字化转型专家、有关初创公司如何改变业务的见解以及探索业务与技术的连接点。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/turning-every-vehicle-factory-and-building-into-a-power-source.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 03 Aug 2026 13:41:34 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/turning-every-vehicle-factory-and-building-into-a-power-source</guid></item><item><title>基于 MicroRNA 的基因疗法治疗 ALS</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/microrna-based-gene-therapy-to-treat-als</link><description>单次静脉注射基于 microRNA 的生物制剂可抑制导致肌萎缩侧索硬化症 (ALS) 的突变型 SOD1 蛋白的产生；延迟发病 60 天；该疾病小鼠模型的寿命延长了 100 天，是平均存活时间的三倍多。&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/microrna-based-gene-therapy-to-treat-als2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 03 Aug 2026 13:26:34 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/microrna-based-gene-therapy-to-treat-als</guid></item><item><title>克服癌症耐药性：有效治疗的策略和方式</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/overcoming-cancer-resistance-strategies-and-modalities-for-effective-treatment</link><description>抗癌药物耐药性是一种复杂的现象，对各种恶性肿瘤的治疗提出了重大挑战。这篇综述全面探讨了癌症抵抗机制，并讨论了克服这一障碍的新兴策略和方式。许多因素都会导致癌症耐药性，包括基因突变、替代信号通路的激活以及肿瘤微环境的改变。靶向蛋白质降解、免疫治疗组合、精准医疗和新型药物输送系统等创新方法有望改善治疗结果。了解癌症耐药性的复杂性并利用创新方式对于推进癌症治疗至关重要。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/overcoming-cancer-resistance-strategies-and-modalities-for-effective-treatment2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 03 Aug 2026 13:11:34 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/overcoming-cancer-resistance-strategies-and-modalities-for-effective-treatment</guid></item><item><title>肌肉细胞如何生长并保持健康</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/how-muscle-cells-grow-and-stay-healthy</link><description>生物物理学家解开了肌肉如何在分子水平上形成以及它们如何维持其功能的谜团。&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/how-muscle-cells-grow-and-stay-healthy2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 03 Aug 2026 12:56:34 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/how-muscle-cells-grow-and-stay-healthy</guid></item><item><title>脑外伤中的脑水肿</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/cerebral-edema-in-traumatic-brain-injury</link><description>脑水肿是脑实质任何组织室中液体的异常积聚。它仍然是神经创伤护理中的一个重大挑战，因为它会导致继发性脑损伤，影响预后。本综述分析了最近的文献，包括基础研究，以描述创伤性脑损伤（TBI）后不同类型脑水肿的机制。类淋巴系统和血红素衍生炎症小体的作用等新兴概念为新型水肿提供了新的见解，这些水肿的发病机制和潜在治疗方法有所不同。了解这些分子机制的最新进展可以改善治疗策略，促进精准和个性化医疗时代更好的方法。&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/cerebral-edema-in-traumatic-brain-injury2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 03 Aug 2026 12:41:34 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/cerebral-edema-in-traumatic-brain-injury</guid></item><item><title>脑部 MRI 筛查是否应该扩大转移性乳腺癌的筛查范围？</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/should-brain-mri-screening-expand-in-metastatic-breast-cancer</link><description>脑转移是转移性疾病临床关注的一个主要问题&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/should-brain-mri-screening-expand-in-metastatic-breast-cancer.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 03 Aug 2026 12:26:34 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/should-brain-mri-screening-expand-in-metastatic-breast-cancer</guid></item><item><title>放射治疗和免疫治疗联合治疗晚期非小细胞肺癌</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/combination-of-radiotherapy-and-immunotherapy-in-advanced-nonsmall-cell-lung-cancer</link><description>脑水肿是脑实质任何组织室中液体的异常积聚。它仍然是神经创伤护理中的一个重大挑战，因为它会导致继发性脑损伤，影响预后。本综述分析了最近的文献，包括基础研究，以描述创伤性脑损伤（TBI）后不同类型脑水肿的机制。类淋巴系统和血红素衍生炎症小体的作用等新兴概念为新型水肿提供了新的见解，这些水肿的发病机制和潜在治疗方法有所不同。了解这些分子机制的最新进展可以改善治疗策略，促进精准和个性化医疗时代更好的方法。尽管已经取得了显着的进展，但有必要提出针对不同类型水肿定制治疗方法的建议，以改善创伤性脑损伤后的结果。在这篇综述中，我们描述了当前创伤后脑水肿的亚型，并将它们与特定的治疗方法联系起来。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/combination-of-radiotherapy-and-immunotherapy-in-advanced-nonsmall-cell-lung-cancer2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 03 Aug 2026 12:11:34 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/combination-of-radiotherapy-and-immunotherapy-in-advanced-nonsmall-cell-lung-cancer</guid></item><item><title>立体定向放射治疗与海马避免全脑放射治疗</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/stereotactic-radiotherapy-vs-hippocampalavoidance-whole-brain-radiation</link><description>随着晚期癌症患者的寿命延长，脑转移现已成为一种常见甚至慢性疾病，可通过多种全身药物和局部治疗进行控制。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/stereotactic-radiotherapy-vs-hippocampalavoidance-whole-brain-radiation2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 03 Aug 2026 11:56:34 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/stereotactic-radiotherapy-vs-hippocampalavoidance-whole-brain-radiation</guid></item></channel></rss>